{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_adr_adr_021_layers_equipment_scene", "label": "ADR-021 The Layers screen as a stack that zooms onto a layer's equipment", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-021-layers-equipment-scene.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_021_layers_equipment_scene_layerstack3d", "label": "LayerStack3D scene", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-021-layers-equipment-scene.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Twelve slate planes in contract order under a three-quarter orthographic camera; a first cut with translucent wafers and abstract holographic glyphs was rejected as 'game inspired'; twelve tiles in three rows lost the layering sequence; the ordered stack was judged the right overview. Frames render on demand; materials shared per tier; DPR capped as in the twin."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_021_layers_equipment_scene_overview_then_focus", "label": "Overview then focus interaction", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-021-layers-equipment-scene.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Click on a plane or list row eases the camera onto it (380 ms), recedes other planes and stands the layer's equipment on it; focus panel shows count, health split, platform marks and a CMDB link filtered by ?layer=; Escape, Back or second click returns. Orbit limited to the three-quarter reading; nothing spins."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_021_layers_equipment_scene_layer_stack_model", "label": "layer-stack-model.ts (pure model)", "file_type": "code", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-021-layers-equipment-scene.md", "source_location": "apps/console/src/lib/layer-stack-model.ts", "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Plane positions, label anchors, equipment family, units, marks, overview and focus poses are pure and unit tested; the scene only draws."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_021_layers_equipment_scene_layer_equipment", "label": "LAYER_STACK / LAYER_EQUIPMENT schematic equipment", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-021-layers-equipment-scene.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Realistic objects per layer (42U cabinets, switch and firewall, 2U servers, disk shelf, host with VM cards, AZ slabs, drums for databases...) because Syed wants layers shown as what they hold; a layer repeats its unit one to three times by its share of the largest count; Record<CiLayer, ...> forces a family for every layer."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_021_layers_equipment_scene_layer_marks", "label": "LAYER_MARKS vendor marks", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-021-layers-equipment-scene.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Shown as crisp inline SVG beside the row in the visibility list, never inside the canvas where they would be too small; Microsoft, Azure, AWS, Hyper-V, Oracle, Salesforce, ServiceNow withdrew from simple-icons and appear as names in a chip (nominative use); a mark is shown only beside the platform it names because of trademarks."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_021_layers_equipment_scene_simple_icons", "label": "simple-icons 16.36.0 (CC0-1.0)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-021-layers-equipment-scene.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Bundled, no network, licence-clean asset catalogue joining the component table."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_021_layers_equipment_scene_text_stays_html", "label": "Text stays HTML, nothing lettered in the canvas", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-021-layers-equipment-scene.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Plane labels are DOM nodes positioned by projecting each plane's front corner through the camera; the visibility list is the legend and keyboard path; an sr-only plane list mirrors the scene for assistive technology and is what the e2e (T-126) reads via data-layer / data-visible / data-focused."}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_021_layers_equipment_scene_t_126", "label": "T-126 Layers e2e", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-021-layers-equipment-scene.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_adr_adr_021_layers_equipment_scene_req_ui_033", "label": "REQ-UI-033", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-021-layers-equipment-scene.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "docs_adr_adr_021_layers_equipment_scene", "target": "docs_adr_adr_021_layers_equipment_scene_layerstack3d", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-021-layers-equipment-scene.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_adr_021_layers_equipment_scene_layerstack3d", "target": "docs_adr_adr_021_layers_equipment_scene_layer_stack_model", "relation": "calls", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-021-layers-equipment-scene.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_adr_021_layers_equipment_scene_layer_stack_model", "target": "docs_adr_adr_021_layers_equipment_scene_layer_equipment", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "docs/adr/ADR-021-layers-equipment-scene.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "docs_adr_adr_021_layers_equipment_scene_layer_stack_model",